{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What the fish??</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gawr Gura: Quest for Bread is an action-platformer fan game where you jump, spin, and fight through unknown lands to help Gura reunite with her lost bread!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054520/extras/dialogue.gif?t=1744396584\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Roughly 3 hours of content</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tight, acrobatic platforming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simple but satisfying combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique and challenging boss fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cameos from all five members of HoloMyth</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054520/extras/combat_new.gif?t=1744396584\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054520/extras/launch.gif?t=1744396584\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">This isn't a beach, this is a bathtub!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are plenty of inside jokes and callbacks to past Hololive streams, but no knowledge of the streamers is needed to enjoy the game! </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2054520?t=1744396584","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2054520?t=1744396584","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054520/ceac14f1e2e621cb186ad15c79b45dfa5e7d08dc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744396584","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2054520/ceac14f1e2e621cb186ad15c79b45dfa5e7d08dc/capsule_184x6